          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Military Service in Israel</strong><br>\nIn Israel, military service is mandatory for both men and women. Women serve in various units and have the opportunity to pursue careers in many areas of the military. Military service also promotes equality and cohesion in society.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Legal Rights in Palestine</strong><br>\nIn the Palestinian territories, the legal rights of women are often limited, and there are fewer laws protecting against discrimination. Women's rights can vary depending on the region and the prevailing political and social structure there.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Social Roles in Palestine</strong><br>\nIn Palestine, traditional and religious values often have a strong influence on the roles of men and women. Women have less access to education and job opportunities compared to men. However, in some areas, there are efforts to promote gender equality.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
